{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794528144945,"sessionID":"ses_e2dcb0d53ffeBaw5RhZ4h4KChT","part":{"partID":"prt_1d236673f001tgZ5V8NLYbB5za","sessionID":"ses_e2dcb0d53ffeBaw5RhZ4h4KChT","messageID":"msg_1d23655a20014r08DEiSqrCUev","type":"tool","id":"call_e8d999db24b84ee89928373f","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"INSTALL-SKILLED.md","oldString":"Open the repository in any of the six runtimes: OpenCode, Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Devin or Pi. Then run:","newString":"Open the repository in any of the seven runtimes: OpenCode, Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Devin, Pi or DeepSeek Harness (DSH). Then run:"},"output":"Edited INSTALL-SKILLED.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"INSTALL-SKILLED.md","patch":"Index: INSTALL-SKILLED.md\n===================================================================\n--- INSTALL-SKILLED.md\n+++ INSTALL-SKILLED.md\n@@ -53,9 +53,9 @@\n ```\n \n ### Check the Install\n \n-Open the repository in any of the six runtimes: OpenCode, Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Devin or Pi. Then run:\n+Open the repository in any of the seven runtimes: OpenCode, Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Devin, Pi or DeepSeek Harness (DSH). Then run:\n \n ```\n /doctor:setup\n ```\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited INSTALL-SKILLED.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\":\"INSTALL-SKILLED.md\",\"oldString\":\"Open the repository in any of the six runtimes: OpenCode, Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Devin or Pi. Then run:\",\"newString\":\"Open the repository in any of the seven runtimes: OpenCode, Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Devin, Pi or DeepSeek Harness (DSH). Then run:\"}"},"time":{"start":1794528143167,"end":1794528144945}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794528144980,"sessionID":"ses_e2dcb0d53ffeBaw5RhZ4h4KChT","part":{"partID":"prt_1d2366a01001XS5YtIDfMVp5z7","sessionID":"ses_e2dcb0d53ffeBaw5RhZ4h4KChT","messageID":"msg_1d23655a20014r08DEiSqrCUev","type":"tool","id":"call_3790bfb168d5419786955227","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"INSTALL-SKILLED.md","oldString":"Codex, Cursor and Pi spell commands with a hyphen, as in `/doctor-setup`. Devin reaches the spec-kit workflows through its `/system-spec-kit` skill.","newString":"Codex, Cursor, Pi and DSH spell commands with a hyphen, as in `/doctor-setup`. Devin reaches the spec-kit workflows through its `/system-spec-kit` skill.\n\nDSH loads the repository's guards and the skill advisor only from the patches a run names, so start it with `--patch .dsh/patches/guards.patch.yml`."},"output":"Edited INSTALL-SKILLED.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"INSTALL-SKILLED.md","patch":"Index: INSTALL-SKILLED.md\n===================================================================\n--- INSTALL-SKILLED.md\n+++ INSTALL-SKILLED.md\n@@ -61,10 +61,12 @@\n ```\n \n It checks the install without changing anything. It names one repair command for each failure.\n \n-Codex, Cursor and Pi spell commands with a hyphen, as in `/doctor-setup`. Devin reaches the spec-kit workflows through its `/system-spec-kit` skill.\n+Codex, Cursor, Pi and DSH spell commands with a hyphen, as in `/doctor-setup`. Devin reaches the spec-kit workflows through its `/system-spec-kit` skill.\n \n+DSH loads the repository's guards and the skill advisor only from the patches a run names, so start it with `--patch .dsh/patches/guards.patch.yml`.\n+\n Codex runs a project hook only after you approve it, so open `/hooks` in a Codex session at the repository root and approve each entry it lists. Codex keeps each approval as a `trusted_hash` in `~/.codex/config.toml`, so a changed entry needs approving again, and `/doctor:runtime-mirrors` prints `PASS codex-hooks-approved` once the advisor's entry is approved.\n \n ### Add Code Mode\n \n","status":"modified","additions":3,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited INSTALL-SKILLED.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\":\"INSTALL-SKILLED.md\",\"oldString\":\"Codex, Cursor and Pi spell commands with a hyphen, as in `/doctor-setup`. Devin reaches the spec-kit workflows through its `/system-spec-kit` skill.\",\"newString\":\"Codex, Cursor, Pi and DSH spell commands with a hyphen, as in `/doctor-setup`. Devin reaches the spec-kit workflows through its `/system-spec-kit` skill.\\n\\nDSH loads the repository's guards and the skill advisor only from the patches a run names, so start it with `--patch .dsh/patches/guards.patch.yml`.\"}"},"time":{"start":1794528143873,"end":1794528144980}}}}
